格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness eDEX-UI shell plugin — a terminal-inspired by https://github.com/GitSquared/edex-ui overlay for the DSH web GUI. Adds a classic eDEX-UI layout: system telemetry left bar, world-map right bar, filesystem browser, and a terminal-styled composer input — all wrapped ","id":"gh:1339673950","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-edex-ui","slug":"ph4310822/dsh-edex-ui","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness eDEX-UI shell plugin — a terminal-inspired by https://github.com/GitSquared/edex-ui"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" overlay for the DSH web GUI. Adds a classic eDEX-UI layout: system telemetry left bar, world-map ri"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ght bar, filesystem browser, and a terminal-styled composer input — all wrapped "},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-edex-ui"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness eDEX-UI shell plugin** — a terminal-inspired by https://github.com/GitSquared/ede"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"x-ui overlay for the\nDSH web GUI. Adds a classic eDEX-UI layout: system telemetry left bar, world-ma"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"p\nright bar, filesystem browser, and a terminal-styled composer input — all wrapped\naround the origi"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" bar, filesystem browser, and a terminal-styled composer input — all wrapped\naround the original UI."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Left bar** — system overview panel: CPU, memory, swap, processes, platform\ninfo, and thermal/pow"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"er state, with per-core CPU sparklines\n- **Right bar** — network status + encom-globe world view wit"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"h endpoint markers\nand spline links, plus a dual up/down traffic chart with grid\n- **Top panel** — a"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"n empty full-width strip overlaying the shell's top edge\nabove every layer (ready for future chrome)"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"\n- **Bottom panel** — one strip hosting three swappable widgets, each wrapped in\nthe same title/bord"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"er chrome:\n- **DIR** — filesystem browser as a terminal-style LIST (icon + name +\nDIR/FILE), the sam"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"e width as the left bar, with storage bar\n- **PREVIEW** — file preview / editor pane (text, code, im"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"ages), spanning\nthe center region\n- **TERMINAL** — a real host shell: commands execute through the\n`"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"systemMetrics.runCommand` Remote (`sh -c`, 30s timeout), with client-side\n`cd`/`clear`/`help`/`pwd`,"},{"id":"p5s10","text":" ↑/↓ history, and a prompt that follows the\nfilesystem browser until you run your first command\n- **"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"Terminal-styled composer** — flattened input capsule, green block caret, and\na `~/<workspace>` path "},{"id":"p5s12","text":"prompt at the left edge of the input area\n- **Workspace-follow** — the dir panel and prompt track th"},{"id":"p5s13","text":"e active conversation's\nworkspace; switching sessions navigates both the filesystem browser and the\n"},{"id":"p5s14","text":"prompt\n- **Green-on-black skin** — token overrides recolour the entire original UI to\nterminal green"},{"id":"p5s15","text":", without touching the user's theme preference"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The plugin is published to npm as `@danielng23/dsh-edex-ui`. From the harness\ncheckout:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"To run the local checkout instead of the npm release (for development), add\nthe bundle with a `file:"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"` path — its `file:` dependency specs link the local\nsub-packages:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"See LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md for the three-instance port\nlayout (3080 baseline / 3081 npm / 3083 local),"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" the build, and the iteration\nworkflow."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"See LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md for the full build, install,\nand iteration workflow. The widget architectur"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"e for the shell bars is\ndocumented in WIDGETS.md."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Packages"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Package | Host/Client | Description |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `packages/bundle` | — | Installable bundle (`cordis.patch.yml`) |\n| `packages/ui-edex` | client | "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"The eDEX shell frame and all panels |\n| `packages/ui-theme-terminal` | client | Appearance → Termina"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"l theme row |\n| `packages/host/system-metrics` | host | System telemetry RPC + file read/write + `ru"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"nCommand` shell execution |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
